  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cycle Kosovo for Children - 9th Edition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cycle Kosovo for Children is a fundraising event, organized annually since 2014. Since then, a group of 40-50 enthusiastic cyclists take part in the annual tour, cycling through major cities in Kosovo, including 500 km of cycling and 6,000 meters of climbing. The money raised this year will be used to purchase medical equipment to cover the needs of the Pediatric Clinic at the Regional Hospital in Ferizaj so that children in this municipality are provided with quality health services.</narrative>
  </description>
